stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Normal

    Normal --> TrapTagged: IF/ID/EX/MEM detects exception
    TrapTagged --> YoungerFlushed: exc_valid in flight
    YoungerFlushed --> TrapTagged: exception sideband advances
    TrapTagged --> WBCommitReady: valid_W & exc_valid_W
    WBCommitReady --> TrapRedirect: trap_target = mtvec
    TrapRedirect --> TrapCSRWrite: write mepc/mcause/mtval/mstatus
    TrapCSRWrite --> Normal: next instruction fetched from mtvec

    Normal --> MRETTagged: decode detects MRET
    MRETTagged --> WBReturnReady: valid_W & is_mret_W & ~exc_valid_W
    WBReturnReady --> MRETRedirect: trap_target = mepc
    MRETRedirect --> MRETCSRWrite: write mstatus restore bundle
    MRETCSRWrite --> Normal: next instruction fetched from mepc

    note right of TrapTagged
        Conceptual state only.
        Current RTL uses combinational
        WB commit logic, not a registered FSM.
    end note
